<!--
  Ambient sound.

  The old sun-and-cloud was built from a sun parked off to the upper left: its
  rays spanned x 1.0..20.7, centring on 10.85 and skewing the whole glyph left
  inside its circle. This is a single symmetric sun centred on (12,12) with
  eight evenly spaced rays, so it is balanced in any container.
-->
